<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Your email was changed</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f7; padding: 24px;">
  <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;">
    <h2 style="color: #1a1a1a;">Your email was changed</h2>
    <p>Hello <%= user.name %>,</p>
    <p>The email for your <%= platformName %> account was just changed to <strong><%= newEmail %></strong>. This address will no longer receive messages from us.</p>
    <p>If this wasn't you, contact the platform administrator straight away.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
